        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='88762' hidden-by-user='true' id='79' type-v2='text' w='87818' x='11624' y='9957'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>Immediate action needed</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Germany females churn at 38% — highest of all groups. Target them with personalised retention offers immediately</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Customers aged 51–60 churn at 57% — more than half leave. Create a dedicated senior retention program</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Inactive members churn at 27.4% vs 13.9% for active — re-engage inactive customers before they exit</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>Watch closely</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#b6992d' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Germany has the worst churn across both genders (38% F, 29% M) — something is wrong in Germany specifically, investigate service/product fit</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#b6992d' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Age 60+ churn is 24% with only 412 customers — small segment but high risk, easy to retain with small effort</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#b6992d' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Spain and France males churn equally at 14% — stable but monitor if Germany&apos;s pattern spreads</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>Double down on what&apos;s working</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Active members with credit cards churn at only 13.9% — your best retention strategy is simply keeping customers active and card-holding</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>71% credit card adoption (6,711 customers) is strong — focus on converting the remaining 29% to reduce their 16.8% churn</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f17b79' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>📌 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Anthropic Sans,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>Age 41–50 is your largest (4,647) and most stable group — invest in loyalty programs here to protect your core base</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#e9ebe0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
